@startuml UC-27
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-27.md
title UC-27: View Cart
footer Feature CART-02 | Business rules: BR-10, BR-19, BR-21
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "CartController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "CartService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open cart
MVC -> API : GET /api/cart (Bearer token or X-Cart-Session)
API -> SVC : GetCartAsync(cartOwner)
SVC -> DB : Select cart lines + variant + product + thumbnail
DB --> SVC : Lines
SVC -> SVC : For each line: current effective price (BR-21),\nline total, IsAvailable = active AND Quantity <= StockQuantity (BR-10)
SVC -> SVC : Selected total = sum of selected, available lines
SVC --> API : CartDto
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt cart empty
  MVC --> U : Show empty cart
else has lines
  MVC --> U : Show lines (unavailable ones marked)\nand selected total
end

@enduml
